Planning&Development Department
2101O'Neil Avenue, Suite202, CheyenneWY82001
(Phone)307-637-6282
A COMMUNITY OF CHOICE
MEMORANDUM
To:
Mayor Marian J. Orr
City Councilmen
From: Susana Montana, Senior Planner
Date: March27,2018
Re:
Change Order/Contract Modification No.3to Contract No.6498with D HM Design
Corporation(DHM)for the Civic Center Commons(CCC)/West Edge Engineering Design
Services entered intoon May11,2016.
This change order request involves three separate requests to amend Contract No.6498 to
accomplish the following:
1.ReimburseD HM for structural engineering design and construction management work for
the Civic Center Commons Project.This work was not included in the work scopeand
budgetfor this contract because the design of the stormwater drainage pond was asyet
undetermined.The contract did have a section called Proposal Notes and Omissions which
is highlighted on thelast page of Exhibit B to the change order request.Item number 2
states"Due to the undetermined programming for the site, wehave not included fees for
storm water conveyance route has changed since the original design and budget estimate
when the CCC project was connected to the26th Street storm water conveyance system.
greater structural steel design, materials and construction management.This work is
needed to complete the CCC project.San Engineering's structural work requiresa change
order to include an additional$20,587.50in the D HM contract.This amount would be
funded54%by the FEMAPre-Disaster Mitigation Grant No.14FEMA-CHE-PD-PDCH14,
22% would be reimbursed by the City's Wyoming State Loan& Investment Board (SLIB)
Grant No.15039forthe Capitol Basin Flood Control Project, and the remaining 24%would
befunded by the 20126t Penny funds for West Edge Flood Control projects such as the
Civic Center Commons Project.
Page 1 of 2
